          "name": "Do I need ceiling paint for a bathroom ceiling?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Not necessarily. A mildew-resistant ceiling paint is a good choice, but a bath-specific wall paint in a low sheen also works, especially on a small ceiling. The important features are moisture and mildew resistance, along with an exhaust fan that runs during and after showers."
          }
